[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11500100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11500100_03_0010","text":"那、个……\n一、二、三——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11500100_03_0020","text":"……怎么样？\n紧张缓解了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11500100_03_0030","text":"……啊呜……\n还、还没怎么…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11500100_03_0040","text":"是、是吗\n那该怎么办呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11500100_03_0050","text":"——啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11500100_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11500100_03_0060","text":"────制作人，先生……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11500100_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11500100_03_0070","text":"小奈……\n千雪小姐……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11500100_03_0080","text":"……观众们……！\n……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11500100_03_0090","text":"……啊……\n感觉，平静下来了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11500100_03_0100","text":"哈哈，那就好\n——好。带着自信，去吧！"}]
